{"4660540": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Bloody Cleanup TOGETHER", "steam_appid": 4660540, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the aftermath of something terrible in <strong>Bloody Cleanup Together,</strong> a co-op horror cleaning simulator for up to 4 players where your job is to erase every trace. 🩸 Clean blood, remove evidence, move bodies, and restore scenes where every detail matters and even the smallest mistake can cost you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🧽 Clean, Hide, Restore</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scrub away blood and stains, collect trash, move objects, and make every location look untouched. The more precise you are, the better your outcome.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >👥 Co-op Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play solo or with up to 4 players. Coordinate tasks, carry bodies together, and manage the cleanup efficiently to finish faster and avoid costly mistakes.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🛠 Tools and Progress</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose the right equipment before each mission and improve your tools over time. Unlock new contracts and take on more complex and disturbing scenes.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >📍 Detailed Locations</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every location is filled with small details. Rearrange furniture, restore objects, and make sure nothing is left out of place.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >👉 Something Feels Wrong</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some jobs are worse than others. Some stains won’t come out easily. And sometimes… it feels like you are not alone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Bloody Cleanup Together</strong>, the job is simple. Clean fast. Clean smart. Leave no evidence.<br>Grab your team and get to work. 🩸</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the aftermath of something terrible in <strong>Bloody Cleanup Together,</strong> a co-op horror cleaning simulator for up to 4 players where your job is to erase every trace. 🩸 Clean blood, remove evidence, move bodies, and restore scenes where every detail matters and even the smallest mistake can cost you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🧽 Clean, Hide, Restore</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scrub away blood and stains, collect trash, move objects, and make every location look untouched. The more precise you are, the better your outcome.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >👥 Co-op Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play solo or with up to 4 players. Coordinate tasks, carry bodies together, and manage the cleanup efficiently to finish faster and avoid costly mistakes.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🛠 Tools and Progress</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose the right equipment before each mission and improve your tools over time. Unlock new contracts and take on more complex and disturbing scenes.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >📍 Detailed Locations</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every location is filled with small details. Rearrange furniture, restore objects, and make sure nothing is left out of place.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >👉 Something Feels Wrong</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some jobs are worse than others. Some stains won’t come out easily. And sometimes… it feels like you are not alone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Bloody Cleanup Together</strong>, the job is simple. Clean fast. Clean smart. Leave no evidence.<br>Grab your team and get to work. 🩸</p>", "short_description": "Clean up the aftermath of terrible events in Bloody Cleanup Together, a co-op horror cleaning sim for up to 4 players. Remove blood, hide evidence, carry bodies, and restore every detail before anything is discovered. 🩸", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4660540/a911ee5329c4bcb331bf7a51012a43f32abf0b42/header.jpg?t=1783348138", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets